  "Question": "Each row of the Misty Moon Amphitheater has \\(33\\) seats. Rows \\(12\\) through \\(22\\) are reserved for a youth club. How many seats are reserved for this club?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(297\\)",
    "B": "\\(330\\)",
    "C": "\\(363\\)",
    "D": "\\(396\\)",
    "E": "\\(726\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "Both rows \\(12\\) and \\(22\\) are included. Subtracting their numbers counts \\(22-12=10\\) steps between rows, so there is one more row than steps: \\(11\\) reserved rows. Each has \\(33\\) seats, giving\n\\[11\\cdot33=\\boxed{363}\\text{ seats},\\]\nchoice \\(\\text{C}\\).",
